{"id":"n81281-2-9","stage":5,"title":"톡톡 · 啪嗒","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n81281-2-9-1","ko":"우리 딴 자리로 가는 게 좋겠어. 나무 위에서 열매들이 자꾸 톡톡 떨어져.","zh":"我们还是去别的地方吧。树上的果子一直不停地掉下来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"딴","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"딴：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"딴","audio":"/audio/cece9bb9f3ddc58383e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62791","senseId":"2","lemma":"딴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"딴","audio":"/audio/cece9bb9f3ddc58383e4.mp3"}},{"text":"자리로","meaning":"位置，位子，地方","explanation":"자리：位置，位子，地方；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"자리","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60332","senseId":"1","lemma":"자리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자리로","audio":"/audio/b74fc6d3041dc2a926e2.mp3"}},{"text":"가는","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가는","audio":"/audio/4df15b29e7ed7afe1cce.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"좋겠어.","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋겠어","audio":"/audio/3b128c5b8414727d9531.mp3"}},{"text":"나무","meaning":"树，树木","explanation":"나무：树，树木","readings":[{"term":"나무","audio":"/audio/b294b251f77dfbc5ede4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32750","senseId":"1","lemma":"나무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나무","audio":"/audio/b294b251f77dfbc5ede4.mp3"}},{"text":"위에서","meaning":"上","explanation":"위：上；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"위","audio":"/audio/e0bebb354d8f7f3b0c82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71462","senseId":"1","lemma":"위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"위에서","audio":"/audio/cfcc067b42f049977fe6.mp3"}},{"text":"열매들이","meaning":"果实","explanation":"열매：果实；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"열매","audio":"/audio/34e07c18fd5adbdaefab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14093","senseId":"1","lemma":"열매","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"열매들이","audio":"/audio/44ff354eae7757343026.mp3"}},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}},{"text":"톡톡","meaning":"啪嗒","explanation":"톡톡：啪嗒","readings":[{"term":"톡톡","audio":"/audio/5948cdd6cac8f33c02c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81281","senseId":"2","lemma":"톡톡","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"톡톡","audio":"/audio/5948cdd6cac8f33c02c5.mp3"}},{"text":"떨어져.","meaning":"掉，下降","explanation":"떨어지다：掉，下降；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"떨어지다","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89796","senseId":"1","lemma":"떨어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"te